## GitHub Structure

```
data-science-journey/
├── README.md                    ← roadmap overview + progress table
├── CONTEXT.md                   ← this file, keep updated
├── phase1-python-fundamentals/
│   ├── 01-variables-datatypes/variables_datatypes.ipynb
│   ├── 02-operators/operators.ipynb
│   └── ... (one file per topic, reused across all reviews)
├── phase2-math-stats/
├── phase3-sql/
└── kaggle-projects/
    ├── titanic/
    └── house-prices/
```

One notebook per topic, permanent — reviews are new **commits** to the same file, not new files. Commit message convention:
- `Day 0: initial blind build — [topic]`
- `Review Day N: passed — [what was rebuilt]`
- `Review Day N: failed → corrected → reset to Day 1`
- `Review Day 35: mastered`

